#: ../../source/users/interface/folio_tabs.rst:7
msgid "Folio tabs bar"
msgstr "图幅标签栏"

#: ../../source/users/interface/folio_tabs.rst:9
msgid ""
"The folio tabs bar can be considered part of the `workspace`_. The folio "
"tabs bar contains one tab for each `folio`_ of the `project`_."
msgstr ""
"图幅标签栏可以视为 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的一部分。图幅标签栏为 `项目 <project_>`_ 中的每个 `图幅 "
"<folio_>`_ 包含一个标签。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/folio_tabs.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech folio tabs bar"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图幅标签栏"

#: ../../source/users/interface/folio_tabs.rst:17
msgid "The folio tabs bar allows the following actions:"
msgstr "图幅标签栏允许执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/users/interface/folio_tabs.rst:19
msgid "Choosing the active folio by simple click on the tab."
msgstr "通过单击标签选择活动图幅。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/folio_tabs.rst:20
msgid ""
"Opening the properties PopUp window from an specific folio by double click "
"on the tab."
msgstr "通过双击标签打开特定图幅的属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/folio_tabs.rst:21
msgid ""
"Adding new folio to the project by simple click on the **Add folio** icon "
"|add_folio| from right side."
msgstr "单击右侧的 **添加图幅** 图标 |add_folio| ，即可向项目中添加新图幅。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/folio_tabs.rst:23
msgid "add_folio"
msgstr "添加图幅"
